  "goodToKnow": "Mahlen means to grind or mill: Kaffee, Getreide, Pfeffer mahlen. It sounds exactly like malen (to paint), but is spelled with h. Its past is regular (mahlte) but its participle is strong: gemahlen, as in gemahlener Kaffee. The proverb Wer zuerst kommt, mahlt zuerst (first come, first served) comes from mills, where farmers queued to grind grain. Die Mühle is the mill."
